## CLI Surface (target)

```text
retail-sim db migrate [--migrations-dir PATH]
retail-sim stores add N
retail-sim assortment optimize   # or set flag manually in DB
retail-sim simulate --from DATE --to DATE
```

Config via `DATABASE_URL`, `MIGRATIONS_DIR`, `SEED` (`.env`).

